OL,3,GNEWSANI health trusts to announce 12%
OL,4,Asavings plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorthern Ireland's health and social
OL,7,Fcare trusts are expected to announce
OL,8,Fproposals on how they intend to make
OL,9,Fsavings of up to 12% over three years.
OL,11,FThe Permanent Health Secretary has said
OL,12,Fhealth and social care in NI is facing
OL,13,Fenormous challenges. At the moment,
OL,14,Fhealth faces a funding gap of #800m.
OL,16,FMike Farrar said applying 4%
OL,17,Fefficiencies to the system each year
OL,18,Ffor three years will initially impact
OL,19,Fstaffing levels.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
